Z||000000||kevin||03-05-2000||03:23 AM||||I put a lot of thought into what type of engine to put into my 85 SE. Living in Calif. all my life hving thousand of canyon carving swithbacks helped develope my driving style for high revving point and shoot darting. As a result, I decided to place a H.O. Quad-4 behind me. The V-6's are fine, but consistant with their design, they simply don't rev. Now my question; who do you recommend as a shop that has a quality kit for such a conversion? I will take any names other than ACE in Colorado. Everyone I talked to say they are rank amatures.  ||||reg||5
